  "2026-08-03T01:01:22.454Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for sdk entrypoint coverage, RSS/proc race, and auto-release 99.99. pm-f2ne is the closed historical release-script coverage tranche; pm-cg1sjb owns cold-cache latency noise; pm-rtn5h6 owns the defect-escape ratchet. None owns nondeterministic coverage of the /proc disappearance catch. GitHub run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/30775382287."
  "2026-08-03T01:09:08.128Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: added deterministic injected platform/readStatus controls around the procfs sampler and assertions for undefined pid, non-Linux, valid VmRSS, missing VmRSS, and read failure. Focused suite passes 11/11; repository coverage passes 422/422 files and 6,748/6,748 tests at exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. pnpm lint, typecheck, zero-duplicate, docstring 100%, SDK boundary/parity, token/context, SDK surface, benchmark, transport, and diff checks pass."
  "2026-08-03T01:20:13.901Z","harness:codex","CI feedback: Gates (static) correctly found CHANGELOG.md stale after the three merged provenance items were closed on main. Regenerated it with the installed pm-changelog 2026.8.2 extension; direct check now reports unchanged. This is package-owned generated output, not a pm-cli generator change."
  "2026-08-03T01:29:18.294Z","harness:codex","Review feedback: Sourcery requested an explicit malformed-unit negative control and a typed options contract. Added JSDoc LinuxRssReadOptions plus a VmRSS 12 MB assertion that proves unsupported units fail closed. Focused 11-test suite, typecheck, ESLint, changelog check, and diff check pass."
